From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:25:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 363/488] V2 runner sampling: temperature and select in
 Triton's tile form

Temperature loads a thread's runs, divides them, then stores them, at 256
threads a block: stored run by run through the one logits pointer, every load
waited for the store before it. Select reads one rank a lane for a number of
ranks fixed when it is built (the declarations name it), and reduces over the
next power of two, instead of a loop of dynamic length. Against Triton per
call: temperature at one token from +17% to +7%, level at 16; select from
+23-33% to +6-8%.
